      "modelAnswer": "Situation: a specific technical disagreement (e.g. adding a cache vs fixing a query). Task: why it was your concern. Actions: you gathered data, proposed a small experiment or wrote a short comparison, listened to their constraints, and agreed on criteria. Result: the decision taken and its measurable effect — and the relationship stayed good. Reflection: e.g. 'I now bring data before opinions.' Avoid blaming the other person."
